<title>MALAYSIA: Berjaya Group six-mth net up 30.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Berjaya Group six-mth net up 30.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Oct 31, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 13.33	   vs	  10.21</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 1.6	    vs	   1.5</p>
<p>    Turnover		3,140.54	   vs     2,398.18</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  240.52	   vs	 138.66</p>
<p>    Minorities less	 119.45	   vs  less  76.64</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	   9.95	   vs	   4.47</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)	5.0	    vs	   5.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Malaysia's Berjaya Group Bhd is a widely diversified firm.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
